Experience the detailed scenes and life-changing words and parables of Jesus as revealed to the Italian Catholic mystic Maria Valtorta. Excerpts are taken from her greatest work, The Gospel as Revealed to Me (also known as The Poem of the Man-God).

NOTE: Like a Shakespearean play, it is recommended to read Valtorta’s work from front to back at least once before reading isolated excerpts or chapters from her writings in order to fully experience and properly understand the characters and events.


Now available in the App:

- Excerpts from Maria’s work for all of the Sunday Gospel readings of the liturgical year as well as other important feast days;
- All of the Parables of Jesus as Revealed to Maria Valtorta;
- Additional information about Maria Valtorta and her works.
